nd conscientious but uncooperative. Candidate C strong reliability and decision but communication issues. Candidate D strong problem solving and responsibility but arrogance.\n\nMaybe Candidate A is best balanced? He has technical competence, leadership, anticipates danger, but needs improvement in organization and criticism. Those are manageable. Others have more severe crew cooperation issues (B uncooperative, C communication difficulty, D arrogance). So I might vote Candidate A.\n\nThus in first turn, I will present Candidate A's strengths and concerns, compare to others briefly, and give provisional vote for Candidate A, but note need to discuss others.\n\nLet's craft public message."}
